    {
      "reviewId": 9394982,
      "rating": 5,
      "date": "2026-11-09T21:19:00",
      "comment": "We honestly cannot say enough good things about Jess! After spending over a year searching for our first home, touring what felt like countless houses, we can confidently say that Jess was the best realtor we could have asked for.\n\nWhat sets Jess apart is that you can genuinely tell he cares about his clients as people, not just as another sale. Throughout our entire search, he never made us feel rushed or pressured. His priority was always helping us find the RIGHT home, not simply getting us into a house. He was honest with us, gave us his genuine opinions, and wasn’t afraid to point out potential concerns or things he noticed during showings. We always knew he had our best interests in mind, and that meant so much to us.\n\nThere was even a point when we were under contract on a home and, due to an unexpected family emergency, had to back out at the last minute. Jess was incredibly empathetic, understanding, and supportive during what was already a difficult time. He even went out of his way to send us flowers. That gesture really showed us the kind of person he is and how much he genuinely cares.\n\nAs first-time homebuyers, having someone we could completely trust made all the difference. We had toured homes with other realtors before meeting Jess, and the difference was night and day. We never had to question whether he was looking out for us because we knew he was.\n\nWe have finally found our perfect home, and we truly couldn’t have done it without him. If you’re looking for a realtor who is knowledgeable, honest, patient, compassionate, and genuinely invested in finding the right home for you, Jess is your person. We would recommend him a thousand times over!",
