      "rating": 5,
      "date": "2026-11-08T16:39:00",
      "comment": "Noe was a joy to work with, start to finish. He helped us sell our condo and then find and buy our new house, and we couldn't be happier. He's friendly, professional, and easy to talk to. He really listened to what we needed and what we liked, never pushed us, and always gave us good advice. He answered every question quickly and was super helpful at every step, even jumping in to sort out problems that came up during the inspection. He's also clearly knowledgeable, and he did a great job with the open houses and marketing. Along the way he became a good friend. My wife and I love our new place, and we'd strongly recommend Noe to anyone buying or selling.",
